WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:03.703
Unit nineteen. Food Safety at Home!

2
00:00:04.634 --> 00:00:07.871
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:07.921 --> 00:00:10.939
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:10.989 --> 00:00:14.394
Today we learn about Food Safety at Home. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.526 --> 00:00:19.159
Food safety. Say it with me. Food safety!

6
00:00:22.659 --> 00:00:25.659
Clean. Say it with me. Clean!

7
00:00:29.154 --> 00:00:32.438
Separate. Say it with me. Separate!

8
00:00:35.939 --> 00:00:38.789
Cook. Say it with me. Cook!

9
00:00:42.294 --> 00:00:45.394
Chill. Say it with me. Chill!

10
00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:52.257
Raw meat. Say it with me. Raw meat!

11
00:00:55.781 --> 00:00:59.315
Cutting board. Say it with me. Cutting board!

12
00:01:02.743 --> 00:01:06.326
Food poisoning. Say it with me. Food poisoning!

13
00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:18.788
Food safety has four steps: clean, separate, cook, and chill. Keep raw meat separate and use a different cutting board. Following these steps prevents food poisoning.

14
00:01:18.838 --> 00:01:21.627
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:23.317 --> 00:01:28.288
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.338 --> 00:01:29.488
Separate!

17
00:01:30.342 --> 00:01:35.236
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:35.286 --> 00:01:36.436
Cutting board!

19
00:01:37.359 --> 00:01:43.251
Did you know? Germs from raw meat can spread to other food through knives and chopping boards!

20
00:01:43.301 --> 00:01:45.100
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:45.795 --> 00:01:53.582
Think and answer. Why keep raw meat away from ready-to-eat food?

22
00:01:53.632 --> 00:01:54.782
Great answer!

23
00:01:55.791 --> 00:02:00.390
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:03.027
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

